

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Sagantaa qulqullina: 0.

>> a := Tarree-wantootaa ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dhugaa ; Homaa ; 666.
a godhi buqqisi kaasi dabaliduratti: ['hi'], dabaliboodatti: 999, xumuri.
Baʼii barreessi: ( a waliingalchi: [','] ), dhaabi.

Sagantaa qulqulleessi-memoorii.
usedMemory1 := (Sagantaa memoorii ? 0).


a := Tarree-wantootaa ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dhugaa ; Homaa ; 666.
a buqqisi. a kaasi. a dabaliduratti: ['hi'], dabaliboodatti: 999.
Baʼii barreessi: ( a waliingalchi: [','] ), dhaabi.


